       usage data AdMob collects, contextual keywords from trip destinations, and the consent
       prompt in the EEA/UK. Link https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites -->

  <section>
    <h2>Deleting Your Data</h2>
    <p>
      Uninstalling Lodestra deletes the data on your device. To delete your backup, open Google Drive on the web → Settings → Manage apps → Lodestra → Delete hidden app data. Trip files in the <em>Lodestra</em> folder of your Drive can be deleted like any other file. You can remove Lodestra's access to your Google account at <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Lodestra is not directed at children under the age of 13.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, we will post the new version on this page and update the "Last updated" date.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:brillianceanimationstudios@gmail.com">brillianceanimationstudios@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
